Daze Wallbox Integration for Home Assistant
===========================================

Original author
---------------

Created by Andrea Restello (@arest).
Upstream project: https://github.com/arest/daze-addon

The integration architecture, config flow, entity model, sensor catalog
and API client are his work, including the reverse engineering of the
Daze web API, which the vendor does not publish.

This repository
---------------

Maintained by Andrea Restello (@arest) at
https://github.com/arest/daze-addon

This repository includes substantial bug-fix contributions originally
developed against a DT01 charger and merged here: authentication,
payload parsing, charge command shape and retry behaviour, state
reporting, and diagnostics.

These are fixes to the original design and carry no claim over the
original work. See the "Contribution highlights" section of README.md
for detail.

